// StrGraphemeClass is what a code point is to the grapheme cluster rules of UAX #29. A string is cut at a position unless
// a rule joins the two sides: this is the part of the rules that needs no Unicode table (the classes are given by the
// ranges the languages in common use occupy), so a mark outside those ranges is a cluster of its own.
enum StrGraphemeClass
